:''Not to be confused with [[Bore Jr.]]''
'''Li'l Bore''' (ちびイノシャシ ''Chibi Inoshashi'', '''Chibi Boar''') is a smaller variant of [[Bore]] that first appears in [[Year's First Dawn (2019)|Year's First Dawn]] during New Year's 2019. It was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

