==Enemy==
This enemy is a much smaller and much weaker variant of Bore. Li'l Bore has really low stats, even so low leveled [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] will be able to kill it with ease.

==Strategy==
Use anything to kill it, as it will most likely die in one hit anyways.

